    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the freight thing, but it feels like the \"pro-highway\" side is always just defending status quo problems. if we want to be serious about the future, shouldn't we just focus on how much better transit is for cities? like, is there even a real debate left, or is it basically settled that we should be moving away from cars entirely?",
